%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 207ddad3e1c90594ba3f48e2a5a6a796, type: 3}
  m_Name: 8. QueueActionTut
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - bodyText: Targeting an enemy adds the Action to the <i>Battle Queue</i>.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d960aa6e94a2c924badfb0dae38bc9b4, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: The Queue is sorted by <i>Speed</i>, with the fastest Action on the
      left resolving first in a round.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b1411cc1e1231574797f223a58264863, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: You can <i>[Hover]</i> over a queued card's icon to check its stats
      again.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57baba5992d9e224988e93fcacf9f7eb, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: Or <i>[Click]</i> on the icon to retrieve the card back into your hand
      in case you change your mind.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57baba5992d9e224988e93fcacf9f7eb, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: Each round, you can queue up <i>however many</i> Actions as you can!
      However...
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57baba5992d9e224988e93fcacf9f7eb, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: "You can\u2019t play two Actions that share the same <i>Speed</i>!
      Can't be in two places at the same time after all."
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b1411cc1e1231574797f223a58264863, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: A red Action in your hand means you played another Action with the
      same <i>Speed</i> already.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37984fb1d201d1246a4e2a0ac7061427, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: Retrieving the conflicting Action from the queue allows you to play
      the red Action.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57baba5992d9e224988e93fcacf9f7eb, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
  - bodyText: Play some cards! Once you're confident in your setup, press <i>Begin</i>
      to start combat.
    speakerName: Ives
    displayingImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 012935b81d93368468e2669b1e3d145f, type: 3}
    sfx: 
    broadcastAnEvent: 0
